 module anchored\" id=\"module-Framework_sig\"><a href=\"#module-Framework_sig\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Framework_sig/index.html\">Framework_sig</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Guarded_cache\"><a href=\"#module-Guarded_cache\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Guarded_cache/index.html\">Guarded_cache</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Concurrency-safe kernel-compilation cache, shared by every GPU backend.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Kernel_args\"><a href=\"#module-Kernel_args\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Kernel_args/index.html\">Kernel_args</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Indexed kernel-argument container.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Launch_hooks\"><a href=\"#module-Launch_hooks\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Launch_hooks/index.html\">Launch_hooks</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Synchronisation-point hook for deferred kernel launches (specs/launch-window.md).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Shared_memory_query\"><a href=\"#module-Shared_memory_query\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Shared_memory_query/index.html\">Shared_memory_query</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Whether a device shares system memory with the host (an APU or integrated GPU), as the backend that owns the device knows it. See the implementation for why this is a hook and not a field. The framework name must be the backend's <code>name</code> (&quot;HIP&quot;, &quot;CUDA/PTX&quot;, &quot;CUDA/C&quot;): a mismatch is read as &quot;not known&quot;.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Typed_value\"><a href=\"#module-Typed_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Typed_value/index.html\">Typed_value</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div>"}